{"id":"vod_md_3185","vodId":"3185","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"伪恋第一季","name_cn":"伪恋第一季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"20集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230824-1/5cfaddb8e32afd22adba1bbfef76c7f5.jpg"},"summary":"自称有着大众脸的高中生一条乐（内山昂辉 配音），其实是著名流氓帮派“集英组”头目的独子，他本想过上平凡人的生活，直到一个美少女转校生桐崎千棘（东山奈央 配音）的出现，他们的命运自此向不可预料的方向发展。这位金发碧眼的混血儿转校生，原来是美国黑帮“蜂巢”老大的千金，为了双方家族能和睦相处，一条乐和千棘必须假装成一对恋人。个性不合的二人，心不甘情不愿地开始了他们的“甜蜜”生活。在打打闹闹的交往中，千棘渐渐喜欢上了一条乐，而一条乐却一直暗恋着同班女生小野寺（花泽香菜 配音），但因为各种原因无法与之心意相通。这对校园三角恋，因为黑帮和警察的介入，越发不受控制……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-28 09:32:18","playable":true,"episodeCount":20,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/GA2mCVk2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/ReusISct/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/2YobwfVW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/dzTPb5LS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/TljiqHaB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/yEjYQx66/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/5rMgCR5C/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230826/GffxbSzf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/HDBfmRsO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/9gRal6ZP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/yp6lnA9Y/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/FpoTtN6b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/mDQe6VI7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/jpT0vO4e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/uuHsYFIf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集",